Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Rust dependencies are fetched by Cargo and keep their own licences:
  libloading     ISC
  serde          MIT OR Apache-2.0
  serde_json     MIT OR Apache-2.0
  core_affinity  MIT OR Apache-2.0
  tokenizers     Apache-2.0 (Hugging Face), with Oniguruma (BSD-2-Clause)

The NVIDIA CUDA driver (libcuda) and NVML (libnvidia-ml) are loaded at runtime from
the host system and are not distributed with Astral.

Quantised weight formats (Q8_0, NVFP4, MXFP4 block layouts) follow the GGML file
format of llama.cpp / ggml, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, MIT License.
Astral's Inkling 2 Mini forward pass is verified against llama.cpp's implementation.

The Inkling 2 Mini DSpark draft follows the published model definition in vLLM,
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project, Apache License 2.0.
